# {{lower_vendor}}/{{lower_name}}

An Arandu module.

## Install

    go get {{module_path}}

## Wire

Modules are composed by hand. Add it to `bootstrap/app.go`:

    import "{{module_path}}"

    app.Register({{package_name}}.New())

There is nothing else to register: no provider to list, no config key to
publish, no discovery step.

## Develop

    go test ./...

